"product.simit" = "Turkish Sesame Simit";
"description.simit" = "A traditional crisp bread ring coated in toasted sesame.";
"ingredients.simit" = "65 g wheat flour, 32 ml water, 1 g yeast, 4 g grape molasses, 12 g sesame, 1 g salt.";
"recipe.simit" = "1 piece · approximately 100 g\n\nKnead and prove for 45 minutes. Twist two dough ropes into a ring. Dip in diluted molasses, then sesame. Bake at 210 °C for about 18–22 minutes.\n\nSuggested cafe recipe; calories vary with portion and ingredients. Confirm cross-contact information with the cafe.";
"allergens.simit" = "Wheat / gluten, sesame.";
